674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L6OT72TsPlYQ7kNvwGlbzw5&_nc_oc=Ado2T66-bb_B1C0tPxFUz9rrRy_UvScXXnAu3Vjt3gsyMJgdjGzmWOfcQ3SIRU3oWPU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3q_8_dQATijPK2_jn52bjjFT7MgBeh6QoaE4ZNq2RYhw&oe=69F4B959"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gFu6fVhZvQQQ7kNvwEiFKon&_nc_oc=AdpW-nm4B6z3J-l0GA6ZQKuM3pbpG8KRTFknMI28NFFVIsKOaKwpnNbSM5y6_3Rb7qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1pA4nwFkPQSZ8Jf35x3C_vr-3Jn3BuVyOrXbHjjzeKYg&oe=69F4C216"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ccA30u7GbkUQ7kNvwH0KlX7&_nc_oc=Adr3s9hhNk0jIgC2KtdmKgKm0SqhVBuaA4h20U-VGfitsF8NCT-UOaDvFTyl82li4js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af33eNpTtYSaGfwLEgaNTpkOcipDeIZ7Do3sHIBjbWFD2A&oe=69F4BE31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip